DESCRIPTION:Jackie Kashian's comedy is like listening to a really racy epis
 ode of All Things Considered. She is comic\, writer\, and occasional actor.
 .. she just did her first late night set on the Conan O’Brien show\, has 
 a half hour special on Comedy Central and has recorded an episode of This A
 merican Life with Ira Glass\, Her latest CD\, "It Is Never Going To Be Brea
 d" was one of the top ten comedy albums of the year on Amazon. She hosts a 
 weekly cult fave podcast called "The Dork Forest" where she creates a safe 
 space for people to admit that thing they dork out about more than anyone.\
